WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.071
Now apply the same reasoning to e-commerce data
Device type is nominal

00:00:06.994 --> 00:00:12.573
Membership tier is ordinal when the business defines
a real rank Session duration is a

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:18.693
ratio measurement Purchases are a ratio count
Weekday

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.391
is interesting because it is often treated as a
nominal or cyclical category rather than

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:29.222
a simple ordinal variable Revenue is a ratio-scale
monetary amount

00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:33.604
but its database storage should use exact arithmetic
and document currency
